      <h1 style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 800;">About EB Rentals &amp; Sales — Miramar Beach, FL</h1>

      <div style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-text-primary); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 24px;">
          We're your local electric bike shop serving Miramar Beach, Destin, Sandestin, and the beaches of 30A. Riders, renters, and gear heads who believe the Emerald Coast is best explored on two wheels — we rent quality e-bikes by the hour, day, or week, and sell the bikes we ride ourselves.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 32px 0 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-text-primary);">Our Mission</h2>
        <p>Vacationing on the Emerald Coast should be easy. Skip the rental car, skip the parking headache — grab a fully charged e-bike and cruise Scenic Gulf Drive, the Timpoochee Trail, or straight to the sand. For locals, we're your neighborhood shop for buying your own ride: honest advice, real test rides, and fair prices.</p>

        <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 32px 0 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-text-primary);">What We Do Differently</h2>
        <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>We ride everything we rent and sell</strong> — No filler, no paid placements. If we haven't ridden it, we don't rent it.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Delivered to your door</strong> — Condos, hotels, and vacation rentals in Miramar Beach &amp; Destin. We deliver charged, fitted, and ready.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Real people, real support</strong> — Call or text <a href="tel:8502998575" style="color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700;">850-299-8575</a> and you get us, not a call center. Questions before or after your rental, we're here.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Try before you buy</strong> — Rent one, love it? Your rental credit goes toward the purchase price.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 32px 0 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-text-primary);">Why E-Bikes?</h2>
        <p>Vacation parking in Destin can run $30–$50 a day, traffic on Highway 98 stacks up all summer, and most of the best spots are within a short ride anyway. An e-bike costs pennies per charge, lets you skip the parking deck entirely, and turns the ride itself into the best part of the day. Flat, scenic, and made for cruising — the Emerald Coast is e-bike country.</p>
        <p>We've seen families trade the rental car for a week of e-bikes. We've seen snowbirds ride every morning from October to April. We've seen sunset rides become the highlight of the trip. The e-bike isn't just transportation here — it's the whole vacation upgrade.</p>

        <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 32px 0 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-text-primary);">Contact Us</h2>
